n":[{"type":"text","value":"text?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional text?: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"uri","children":[{"type":"text","value":"uri"}]},{"type":"code","value":"uri: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"serverid","children":[{"type":"text","value":"serverId?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional serverId?: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L594","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:594"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pool prefix / config key — routes interactive calls to the right MCP server."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"toolcallid","children":[{"type":"text","value":"toolCallId"}]},{"type":"code","value":"toolCallId: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L597","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:597"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Links the widget to the originating tool call — correlates it with the\nsibling ToolCallPart/ToolResultPart in the same message."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"toolname","children":[{"type":"text","value":"toolName"}]},{"type":"code","value":"toolName: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L600","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:600"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Server-native (unprefixed) MCP tool name whose UI this resource renders.\nRequired by the renderer ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@mcp-ui/client"},{"type":"text","value":"'s "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AppRenderer"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"toolName"},{"type":"text","value":" prop)."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"type","children":[{"type":"text","value":"type"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type: \"ui-resource\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L590","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:590"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"meta","text":"meta?","level":3},{"id":"resource","text":"resource","level":3},{"id":"blob","text":"blob?","level":4},{"id":"mimetype","text":"mimeType","level":4},{"id":"text","text":"text?","level":4},{"id":"uri","text":"uri","level":4},{"id":"serverid","text":"serverId?","level":3},{"id":"toolcallid","text":"toolCallId","level":3},{"id":"toolname","text":"toolName","level":3},{"id":"type","text":"type","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:589](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L589)\n\n## Properties\n\n### meta?\n\n```ts\noptional meta?: Record<string, unknown>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:603](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L603)\n\nReserved for future passthrough of the resource/tool `_meta.ui` (e.g. frame-size hints).\n Currently always `undefined` — nothing populates this field yet.\n\n***\n\n### resource\n\n```ts\nresource: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:592](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L592)\n\nThe ui:// resource object in MCP-native shape — fed straight to the renderer.\n\n#### blob?\n\n```ts\noptional blob?: string;\n```\n\n#### mimeType\n\n```ts\nmimeType: string;\n```\n\n#### text?\n\n```ts\noptional text?: string;\n```\n\n#### uri\n\n```ts\nuri: string;\n```\n\n***\n\n### serverId?\n\n```ts\noptional serverId?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:594](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L594)\n\nPool prefix / config key — routes interactive calls to the right MCP server.\n\n***\n\n### toolCallId\n\n```ts\ntoolCallId: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:597](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L597)\n\nLinks the widget to the originating tool call — correlates it with the\n sibling ToolCallPart/ToolResultPart in the same message.\n\n***\n\n### toolName\n\n```ts\ntoolName: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:600](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L600)\n\nServer-native (unprefixed) MCP tool name whose UI this resource renders.\n Required by the renderer (`@mcp-ui/client`'s `AppRenderer` `toolName` prop).\n\n***\n\n### type\n\n```ts\ntype: \"ui-resource\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:590](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L590)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: UIResourcePart\ntitle: UIResourcePart\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:589](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L589)\n\n## Properties\n\n### meta?\n\n```ts\noptional meta?: Record<string, unknown>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:603](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L603)\n\nReserved for future passthrough of the resource/tool `_meta.ui` (e.g. frame-size hints).\n Currently always `undefined` — nothing populates this field yet.\n\n***\n\n### resource\n\n```ts\nresource: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:592](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L592)\n\nThe ui:// resource object in MCP-native shape — fed straight to the renderer.\n\n#### blob?\n\n```ts\noptional blob?: string;\n```\n\n#### mimeType\n\n```ts\nmimeType: string;\n```\n\n#### text?\n\n```ts\noptional text?: string;\n```\n\n#### uri\n\n```ts\nuri: string;\n```\n\n***\n\n### serverId?\n\n```ts\noptional serverId?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:594](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L594)\n\nPool prefix / config key — routes interactive calls to the right MCP server.\n\n***\n\n### toolCallId\n\n```ts\ntoolCallId: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:597](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L597)\n\nLinks the widget to the originating tool call — correlates it with the\n sibling ToolCallPart/ToolResultPart in the same message.\n\n***\n\n### toolName\n\n```ts\ntoolName: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:600](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L600)\n\nServer-native (unprefixed) MCP tool name whose UI this resource renders.\n Required by the renderer (`@mcp-ui/client`'s `AppRenderer` `toolName` prop).\n\n***\n\n### type\n\n```ts\ntype: \"ui-resource\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:590](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L590)\n"}
